---
description: ShowShow UI must follow the park-masthead system, not AI-default SaaS or catalog-parody chrome.
globs: apps/showshow/**/*.{css,tsx,ts}
alwaysApply: false
---

Before changing ShowShow layout, CSS, or components, read `apps/showshow/DESIGN.md`.

Do not add Inter/Geist/purple gradients/rounded-2xl cards/three-up icon grids/glass/blobs. Do not put “Art Fair Sourcebook” on screen. Do not use a rust underline or Big Shoulders. Keep 18px body type and 48px tap targets. Show names use `.font-display` (Bricolage Grotesque). Dates and fees use `.font-meta` in the body face.
